/* 重设计 第 1 批：每种登录方式一行（图标 + 名称/当前值 + 操作胶囊），解绑放页面下方 */
.subpage { min-height: 100vh; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 0 var(--xy-layout-page-padding-x) var(--xy-space-6); background: var(--xy-color-page); color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.group-label { display: block; margin: var(--xy-space-4) 0 var(--xy-space-2); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.security-list { overflow: hidden; border-radius: var(--xy-radius-lg); background: var(--xy-color-surface); }
.security-row { position: relative; display: flex; min-height: 64px; box-sizing: border-box; align-items: center; gap: var(--xy-space-3); padding: var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-space-4); }
.security-row + .security-row::before { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; left: var(--xy-space-4); height: 1px; background: var(--xy-color-divider); content: ''; }
.security-icon { display: flex; flex: none; width: calc(var(--xy-space-4) * 2); height: calc(var(--xy-space-4) * 2); align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: var(--xy-radius-lg); background: var(--xy-color-surface-subtle); }
.security-icon image { width: var(--xy-size-icon-row); height: var(--xy-size-icon-row); }
.security-copy { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex: 1; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--xy-space-0-5); }
.security-label { color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.security-value { overflow: hidden; color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.security-pill { position: relative; isolation: isolate; display: flex; flex: none; min-width: calc(var(--xy-space-4) * 4); min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--xy-color-brand); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.security-pill::before { position: absolute; top: 50%; right: 0; left: 0; z-index: var(--xy-z-behind); height: calc(var(--xy-space-4) * 2); margin-top: calc(var(--xy-space-4) * -1); box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid var(--xy-color-brand); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-pill); content: ''; }
.note { display: block; margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.alert-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--xy-space-2); margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); }
.form-error { min-width: 0; flex: 1; color: var(--xy-color-danger); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.retry-button { display: flex; flex: none; min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); align-items: center; color: var(--xy-color-brand); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.danger-zone { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; margin-top: auto; padding-top: var(--xy-space-6); }
.unbind-button { display: flex; min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--xy-space-4); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.danger-note { color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
